><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">백만원</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">공모분야</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">       </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">공공미술 및 조형물 디자인</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">          </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">벽화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">슈퍼그래픽</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">조형물 디자인 등</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">       </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">공공시설물 디자인</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">          </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">시민들이 편리하고 유익하게 활용할수 있는 시설물 디자인 계획 등</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">       </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">좋은 간판 디자인 </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">          </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">공공건축물에 설치된 기존 간판대상으로 새로운 디자인이 적용된 창작간판</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">참여대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">제한없음</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">시상내역 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">금상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">은상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">동상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">장려 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(9</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">접 수 일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2023. 11. 27.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) ~ 12. 1.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움